  <office:body><office:text>
    <text:p text:style-name="PageStart"/>
    <text:p text:style-name="TopTitle">「학교장 허가(승인) 교외체험학습」신청서</text:p>
    <table:table table:name="결재"><table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/><table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/><table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Shade"><text:p text:style-name="P">담임</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Shade"><text:p text:style-name="P">부장</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Shade"><text:p text:style-name="P">교감</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="P"/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="P"/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="P"/></table:table-cell></table:table-row></table:table>
    <table:table table:name="신청서"><table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/><table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/><table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/><table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Shade"><text:p text:style-name="P">학생 성명</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="P"/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Shade"><text:p text:style-name="P">학년　 반　 번</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Shade"><text:p text:style-name="P">휴대전화</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Shade"><text:p text:style-name="P">신청 기간</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p text:style-name="Center">년　 월　 일　~　 월　 일(　 ) 일간</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Shade"><text:p text:style-name="P">출석인정기간</text:p><text:p text:style-name="P">학기당 10일</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p text:style-name="Center">우리 학교 학교장 허가 교외체험학습 규정 및 불허기간을 확인하였음</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Center">시험기간, 성적이의신청기간(3일간), 재시험기간(2일간)에는 불허</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Center">※ 필요 시 담임교사와의 사전 협의 또는 문의</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Blue">서명 또는 (인)</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Shade"><text:p text:style-name="P">학습 내용</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p text:style-name="P">◦ 현장체험학습(　)　◦ 친·인척 방문(　)　◦ 가족동반여행(　)　◦ 고적답사(　)</text:p><text:p text:style-name="P">◦ 향토행사 참여(　)　◦ 기타(　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　)</text:p><text:p text:style-name="P">◦ 감염병 심각 단계로 인한 가정학습(　)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Shade"><text:p text:style-name="P">목적지</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p text:style-name="P"/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Shade"><text:p text:style-name="P">숙박장소</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Shade"><text:p text:style-name="P">보호자명</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="P"/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Shade"><text:p text:style-name="P">관계</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="P">휴대폰</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Shade"><text:p text:style-name="P">인솔자명</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="P">(　 세)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Shade"><text:p text:style-name="P">관계</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="P">휴대폰</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Shade"><text:p text:style-name="P">목 적</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p text:style-name="P"/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Shade"><text:p text:style-name="P">교외</text:p><text:p text:style-name="P">체험</text:p><text:p text:style-name="P">학습</text:p><text:p text:style-name="P">계획</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p text:style-name="P"/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Shade"><text:p text:style-name="P">보호자 외</text:p><text:p text:style-name="P">대리 인솔 시</text:p><text:p text:style-name="P">학생 안전</text:p><text:p text:style-name="P">위임 등에 대한 내용</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">인솔자</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="P">이름:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">연락처</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Center">☎ (　　)- (　　)- (　　　　)</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Shade"><text:p text:style-name="Blue">인솔 내용</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p text:style-name="P"/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Shade"><text:p text:style-name="P">서약</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p text:style-name="P">◦ 미성년자이므로 보호자 동반 체험학습이 원칙이나, 보호자의 위임을 받아 학생의 안전·건강을 책임지고 대리 인솔합니다.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="P">학생과 관련된 안전사고 발생 시 이에 대한 책임을 지겠습니다.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Right">인솔자:　　　　　　　　　　(인)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
    </table:table>
    <table:table table:name="동의"><table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="P">‘(연속) 5일 이상 교외체험학습(가정학습 포함)시 주 1회 이상 자녀(학생)가 담임교사와 통화하여</text:p><text:p text:style-name="P">안전, 건강을 확인시키겠습니다.’　　　　　　　　　□ 동의합니다.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="P">위반 시 위기학생관리위원회 개최를 요청하고, 군청 관련과 또는 수사기관에 신고할 수 있음을</text:p><text:p text:style-name="P">알려드립니다.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table>
    <text:p text:style-name="P">가족동반여행 등 교외체험학습의 경우 미성년자인 자녀의 보호를 위해 보호자 동행함이 원칙임을</text:p>
    <text:p text:style-name="P">안내합니다. 만약 신청 기간 중 발생하는 안전사고는 보호자 책임임을 인지하며, 위 학생의 교외체험</text:p>
    <text:p text:style-name="P">학습을 실시하고자 신청합니다.</text:p>
    <text:p text:style-name="Center">년　 월　 일</text:p>
    <text:p text:style-name="Right">학생:　　　　　　　　　인</text:p>
    <text:p text:style-name="Right">보호자:　　　　　　　　인</text:p>
    <text:p text:style-name="Title">범서중학교장　귀하</text:p>

    <text:p text:style-name="PageStart"/>
    <text:p text:style-name="TopTitle">「학교장 허가(승인) 교외 체험학습 결과보고서</text:p>
    <table:table table:name="결과보고서"><table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/><table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/><table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/><table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Shade"><text:p text:style-name="P">성 명</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Shade"><text:p text:style-name="P">학년 반</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="P">학년　　반　　번</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Shade" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p text:style-name="P">교외체험학습 기간</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p text:style-name="Center">20　 년　 월　 일　~　 월　 일(　 ) 일간</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Shade" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p text:style-name="P">교외체험학습 장소</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p text:style-name="P"/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Shade"><text:p text:style-name="P">학습 내용</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p text:style-name="P">◦ 현장체험학습(　)　◦ 친·인척 방문(　)　◦ 가족동반여행(　)　◦ 고적답사(　)</text:p><text:p text:style-name="P">◦ 향토행사 참여(　)　◦ 기타(　　　　　　)　◦ 감염병 심각단계로 인한 가정학습(　)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Shade"><text:p text:style-name="P">제　목</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p text:style-name="P"/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p text:style-name="Blue">* 각 일정별로 느낀 점, 배운 점 등을 글로 기록하고, 자료, 사진 등으로 학생이 직접 작성합니다. (검은색 볼펜 사용)</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Blue">뒷면 혹은 별지에 해당학생 및 인솔자·체험장소가 포함된 체험학습 관련사진, 입장권, 항공권 등을 첨부합니다.&gt;</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p text:style-name="P"/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p text:style-name="P"/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p text:style-name="P"/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p text:style-name="P"/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p text:style-name="P"/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p text:style-name="P"/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p text:style-name="P"/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p text:style-name="P"/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p text:style-name="P"/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p text:style-name="P"/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p text:style-name="P"/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p text:style-name="P"/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p text:style-name="P"/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p text:style-name="P"/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p text:style-name="P">첨부: 사진(본인 및 배경 포함)　 장, 입장권　 매, 항공권　 매 등</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p text:style-name="Center">위와 같이 「학교장 허가(승인) 교외 체험학습」결과보고서를 제출합니다.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Center">20　.　.　.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Right">보호자 :　　　　　　　　　(서명 또는 인)</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Right">학생 :　　　　　　　　　　(서명 또는 인)</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Title">범서중학교장　귀하</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
    </table:table>
    <text:p text:style-name="P">※ 보고서 제출 기한: 체험학습 종료 후 7일 이내(휴일 포함)</text:p>

    <text:p text:style-name="PageStart"/>
    <text:p text:style-name="Title">「학교장 허가(승인) 교외체험학습」결과보고서(별지)</text:p>
